        "name": "GTX",
        "notes": "The ID.7 GTX is the performance flagship of VW's electric sedan lineup.\nWith dual-motor AWD system producing 340 hp, it accelerates 0-100 km/h\nin just 5.4 seconds while maintaining 595 km WLTP range thanks to the\n86 kWh battery. The GTX trim includes sport-tuned DCC adaptive dampers,\ntorque vectoring, GTX-specific styling, and a comprehensive premium\nequipment package (AR HUD, climate comfort seats, matrix LED headlights).\nBuilt on MEB platform at VW's Emden factory. Competes with BMW i5 M60,\nTesla Model 3 Performance, and Mercedes EQE 500. Perfect for drivers who\nwant both performance and practicality in a spacious executive sedan.\n",
